# Free personal API tokens. Copy this template to a local .env kept out of Git.
FOOTBALL_DATA_TOKEN=
PANDASCORE_TOKEN=
# The worker accepts --env-file /absolute/path/to/.env; values are never logged.
# Football free scores/schedules are delayed. PandaScore uses fixtures/results.
# No in-game rounds, kills, paid statistics or automatic prediction training.
# Polling settings are CLI flags: --cycles 1..100 --interval 30..86400 --pages 1..10.
# Football scope: --competitions PL,PD,BL1,SA,FL1,BSA --interval 60 (pages always 1).
# Explicit foreground service: --forever (mutually exclusive with --cycles).
